  "body": " Premier Power Cleaning\nDriveway & Patio Cleaning\nChesterfield\nCall Today\nWelcome to Premier Power Cleaning\nWelcome to Premier Power Cleaning, my name is Martin Wood, and I have been established since 2004, I can clean any flat surface at your home or place of work, the rotary high pressure equipment i use can remove all stains, moss etc and return the surface to a pristine condition. I take great pride in my work and always go the extra mile to see my clients are happy.\nComplete Driveway & Patio Renovation\n\nI always aim for your complete satisfaction. I am immensely proud of the reputation my business has earned since 2004, I have many clients who employ me year after year and recommend my business on to their friends and family.\n\nI will provide a comprehensive service from applying weedkiller, through the cleaning stage and on to re-sanding and ultimately, applying resin weatherseal if needed.\n\nI do not employ staff, I carry out all the work myself, so you are assured of a personal service from begining to end.\n\nFree Quotes & Advice\n\nTrade clean ups – builders, landscapers etc, if you have to make a mess on your client`s driveway, lets us clean it up for you and your client, we will return your client`s property to as good as new, finishing off the job you started in a professional manner.\n\nFor complete renovation of all your outside areas, be they, block paving, tarmac, concrete slabs, printed concrete, decking, stone, also all garden walls, steps etc, please give me a call, on 01246 865537 or mobile 07970 482956.\n\nView our projects\nContact Us\nFor more information on our services or to arrange a quotation please get in touch.\nGet in touch\nContact Us\n1 Guildford Close\nDanesmoor\nChesterfield\nS45 9BE\n\nTel:\n01246 865537\n\nTel:\n07970 482956\nSocial Media\n\nFacebook\n\nLegal Stuff\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms and Conditions\nCookie Policy\n\n\nCopyright 2026 • Premier Power Cleaning | Built By BWAR!\n\nWe are using cookies to give you the best experience on our website.\n\nYou can find out more about which cookies we are using or switch them off in settings.\n\nAccept",
